*.log

# May be written locally by external developer tooling this repository does
# not generate, deploy, or manage.
.codex/
.agents/

# The macOS global ignore commonly carries an `Icon` rule (Finder custom icons).
# Git on macOS matches ignore patterns case-insensitively, so that rule also
# swallows the DADS `foundations/icon/` directory in the vendored documentation
# archive. Negate it so the archive stays a verbatim copy — see
# docs/adr/0011-vendor-dads-docs-resolve-code-via-npm.md
!.claude/skills/digital-agency-frontend/references/dads-docs/foundations/icon/
